<span data-as=3D"p">In an orchestrator-worker configuration, the orchestrat=
or:</span>
<ul>
<li>Breaks down tasks into subtasks</li>
<li>Delegates subtasks to workers</li>
<li>Synthesizes worker outputs into a final result</li>
</ul>
