<span data-as=3D"p">Agents are typically implemented as an LLM performing a=
ctions using <a class=3D"link" href=3D"https://docs.langchain.com/oss/pytho=
n/langchain/tools">tools</a>. They operate in continuous feedback loops, an=
d are used in situations where problems and solutions are unpredictable. Ag=
ents have more autonomy than workflows, and can make decisions about the to=
ols they use and how to solve problems. You can still define the available =
toolset and guidelines for how agents behave.</span>
